    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696550/extras/ed4b45dd2e4e4e2a24d6b3c499c5af34.poster.avif?t=1734348602\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696550/extras/ed4b45dd2e4e4e2a24d6b3c499c5af34.webm?t=1734348602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696550/extras/ed4b45dd2e4e4e2a24d6b3c499c5af34.mp4?t=1734348602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Immerse yourself in this captivating <i><strong>Tactical FPS/Base Building</strong></i> hybrid, unfolding within a corporate dystopia shrouded in paranoia. In the wake of an inexplicable event that submerged the Earth, known as <i><strong>Aquametsis</strong></i>, a pervasive sense of both terror and paranoia fills the air. As the world grapples with the aftermath, humanity has constructed offshore structures, underwater facilities, and floating cities. Amidst all this chaos, engage in intense tactical espionage and strategic base building as you navigate a realm rife with mystery and danger.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696550/extras/8d56bac4214c048742c1e96cc1666ec0.poster.avif?t=1734348602\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696550/extras/8d56bac4214c048742c1e96cc1666ec0.webm?t=1734348602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696550/extras/8d56bac4214c048742c1e96cc1666ec0.mp4?t=1734348602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Gameplay</h2> Control one of the many skilled mercs of Mercenarium on high-stakes missions where survival is paramount. Utilize a variety of tools to eliminate threats, including security guards, mechs, surveillance cameras, and the unpredictable environment itself. <i><strong>Vigilance is key</strong></i>; ensure your merc is well-prepared to endure the challenges that await beneath the waves.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696550/extras/23140df99e896c6c2f26329e43ed8bb9.poster.avif?t=1734348602\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696550/extras/23140df99e896c6c2f26329e43ed8bb9.webm?t=1734348602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696550/extras/23140df99e896c6c2f26329e43ed8bb9.mp4?t=1734348602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Management</h2> Step into the shoes of a logistics manager, overseeing an organization struggling to thrive in this submerged nightmare. Hire and deploy mercenaries on sabotage missions provided by private companies. Manage your headquarters, build facilities, balance resources, and ensure the success of each mission. The presence of <i><strong>loan sharks</strong></i> breathing down your neck serves as a powerful incentive.",
